[92.516577, "i", "cat > /app/ipython/notes_for_testing.txt << 'EOF'\nIPython Library - Interactive Python Shell\n\nKey Functions to Test:\n\n1. Input transformation (inputtransformer2.py)\n   - TransformerManager.transform_cell() - Transform IPython input\n   - Handle magic commands (%magic, %%magic)\n   - Handle shell commands (!command)\n   - Handle help syntax (object?)\n   - Parse IPython-specific syntax\n\n2. Code completion (completer.py)\n   - IPCompleter.completions() - Generate completions\n   - Handle various completion contexts\n   - Test with malformed input\n\n3. Magic commands (magic.py, magics/)\n   - Magic command parsing and execution\n   - Line magics and cell magics\n   - Test argument parsing\n\n4. Safe evaluation (guarded_eval.py)\n   - guarded_eval() - Safely evaluate expressions\n   - Handle potentially dangerous code\n   - Test with various Python expressions\n\n5. Interactive shell (interactiveshell.py)\n   - run_cell() - Execute code cells\n   - run_line_magic() - Execute magic commands\n   - Handle exceptions and errors\n\n6. Code "]
[92.516642, "i", "inspection (oinspect.py)\n   - Inspector.info() - Get object information\n   - Handle various object types\n\n7. Prefilter (prefilter.py)\n   - PrefilterManager.prefilter_lines() - Pre-process input\n   - Transform special syntax\n\nFuzzing Strategy:\n- Focus on inputtransformer2 with random IPython syntax\n- Test magic command parsing with malformed arguments\n- Test guarded_eval with potentially dangerous expressions\n- Test completion with various code contexts\n- Include edge cases in special syntax (?, !, %, %%)\n- Test with Unicode and special characters\n- Test nested and complex expressions\nEOF\n"]
[92.516754, "o", "cat > /app/ipython/notes_for_testing.txt << 'EOF'\r\n"]
